{"translation":{"id":"lif_wbt","name":"ᤏᤡᤱᤘᤠ᤹ᤑᤢ ᤐᤠ᤺ᤴᤈᤠᤰ ᤁᤢᤛᤱ ᤔᤠᤱᤜᤢᤵ","website":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=lifNT","licenseUrl":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=lifNT","licenseNotes":null,"shortName":"WBT","englishName":"Limbu NT (Limbu Script)","language":"lif","textDirection":"ltr","sha256":"6116919e88a76086a83bb2f30e555928fb0b93d877561f10c5d7384878062fd6","availableFormats":["json"],"listOfBooksApiLink":"/api/lif_wbt/books.json","numberOfBooks":27,"totalNumberOfChapters":260,"totalNumberOfVerses":7875,"languageName":"Limbu","languageEnglishName":"Limbu"},"book":{"id":"1JN","translationId":"lif_wbt","name":"᥇ ᤕᤢᤜᤢᤴᤏᤠ","commonName":"᥇ ᤕᤢᤜᤢᤴᤏᤠ","title":"ᤕᤢᤜᤢᤴᤏᤠᤖᤧ ᤛᤠᤵᤋᤢᤒᤠ ᤌᤡᤰᤛᤡᤃᤣ᤺ᤰᤐᤠ ᤛᤰᤀᤡᤱᤄᤱ","order":62,"numberOfChapters":5,"sha256":"ac7deeef825e3d5a2f615888beb013f4d9d5d38ce2b2f76c8bac152e8662ce9a","firstChapterNumber":1,"firstChapterApiLink":"/api/lif_wbt/1JN/1.json","lastChapterNumber":5,"lastChapterApiLink":"/api/lif_wbt/1JN/5.json","totalNumberOfVerses":104},"chapter":{"number":4,"content":[{"type":"heading","content":["ᤀᤡᤱᤗᤧᤰ ᤔᤠᤱᤏᤡᤱᤘᤠ᤹ᤐᤠ᤺ᤴ ᤁᤧᤒᤠ᤺ᤵᤐᤠᤜᤠ᤹"]},{"type":"verse","number":1,"content":["ᤀᤠᤔᤡ᤺ᤶ ᤀᤠᤴᤈᤢᤶᤛᤣ. ᤕᤖᤡᤰ ᤀᤡᤱᤗᤧᤰᤐᤠ ᤔᤠᤱᤏᤡᤱᤘᤠ᤹ᤐᤠ᤺ᤴ ᤁᤧᤒᤠ᤺ᤵᤐᤠᤜᤠ᤹ ᤀᤡᤰᤛᤠᤍᤡᤱ ᤂᤠᤶᤒᤣ᤺ᤰᤔᤥ ᤁᤧᤖᤧᤰ ᤐᤡᤛᤠᤱ ᤔᤧᤗ᤺ᤴᤍᤧᤀᤠᤱ ᤔᤧᤘᤠ᤹ᤖᤥ॥ ᤂᤧᤸᤗᤧ ᤆᤥᤃᤢᤸᤗᤧ ᤀᤡᤱᤃᤠ᤹ ᤛᤣᤛᤣᤔᤠᤱᤗᤠᤶ ᤐᤠ᤺ᤳᤋᤠ ᤁᤧᤗ᤹ᤒᤠᤜᤠ᤹ ᤁᤠᤰ ᤏᤛᤠ᤺ᤴ ᤔᤧᤈᤥᤃᤧᤶᤛᤡᤶᤔᤡᤴᤏᤧ᤹ᤀᤥ. ᤁᤖ ᤂᤧᤱᤜᤠ᤹ ᤏᤡᤱᤘᤠ᤹ᤑᤢᤔᤠᤱᤗᤠᤶ ᤁᤧᤍᤠ᤺ᤒᤠᤛᤡᤒᤡ ᤔᤧ᤺ᤶᤒᤡ ᤑᤠ᤹ᤀᤠᤱ ᤛᤠ᤹ᤖᤧᤶᤛᤡᤶᤔᤧ᤹ᤀᤥ॥"]},{"type":"verse","number":2,"content":["ᤀᤰᤂᤣᤗ᤹ᤖᤡᤰ ᤂᤧᤱᤜᤠ᤹ ᤏᤡᤱᤘᤠ᤹ᤑᤢᤔᤠᤱᤗᤠᤶ ᤁᤧᤍᤠ᤺ᤒᤠᤛᤡᤒᤡ ᤔᤧ᤺ᤶᤒᤡ ᤑᤠ᤹ᤀᤠᤱ ᤏᤡᤱᤘᤠ᤹ ᤂᤥ᤺ᤔᤠ ᤁᤧᤛᤢᤰᤋᤢᤶᤗᤥ–ᤜᤠ᤺ᤳᤗᤧ ᤕᤧᤛᤢ ᤂᤪᤡᤛ᤻ᤋᤧᤴ ᤔᤧᤴᤇᤠᤶᤃᤧᤴ ᤕᤠᤵᤔᤡ ᤐᤥ᤺ᤰᤂᤧᤀᤠᤱ ᤏᤠᤛᤡᤱᤃᤧᤴ ᤌᤰᤁᤥ ᤋᤩᤧ ᤗ᤹ᤖᤡᤰ ᤋᤧᤴᤍᤡᤱ ᤆᤥᤃᤢ᤹. ᤂᤧᤴ ᤏᤡᤱᤘᤠ᤹ᤑᤢᤔᤠᤱᤗᤠᤶ ᤁᤧᤍᤠ᤺ᤒᤠᤖᤥ॥"]},{"type":"verse","number":3,"content":["ᤁᤖ ᤜᤠ᤺ᤳᤗᤧ ᤕᤧᤛᤢ ᤂᤪᤡᤛ᤻ᤋᤧᤴ ᤏᤠᤛᤡᤱᤃᤧᤴ ᤌᤰᤁᤥ ᤋᤩᤧ ᤗ᤹ᤖᤡᤰ ᤋᤧᤴᤍᤡᤱ ᤔᤧᤈᤥᤃᤢᤴ. ᤂᤧᤴ ᤏᤡᤱᤘᤠ᤹ᤑᤢᤔᤠᤱᤗᤠᤶ ᤔᤧ᤺ᤴ. ᤁᤖ ᤂᤪᤡᤛ᤻ᤋᤖᤧ ᤁᤢᤒᤡᤑᤩᤢᤱᤒᤠᤸᤗᤧ ᤁᤢᤛᤠᤶᤗᤠᤶᤒᤠ ᤋᤩᤧᤒᤠᤖᤥ॥ ᤂᤧᤱᤃ ᤋᤠ᤺ ᤁᤧᤗ᤹ᤒᤠᤴ ᤁᤧᤄᤧᤵᤛᤢᤶᤔᤠᤱ ᤁᤧᤘᤕᤡ᤹. ᤜᤧᤰᤁᤩᤠᤱ ᤀᤡᤰᤛᤠᤍᤡᤱ ᤂᤠᤶᤒᤣ᤺ᤰᤔᤥ ᤋᤃᤡᤛᤠ ᤂᤧᤱᤃ ᤋᤩᤧ ᤆᤢᤖᤧᤀᤠᤱ ᤘᤠ᤹ᤖᤥ॥"]},{"type":"verse","number":4,"content":["ᤀᤠᤔᤡ᤺ᤶ ᤀᤠᤛ᤻ᤛᤠ᤺ᤛᤣ. ᤂᤡᤏᤡ᤹ᤃ ᤏᤡᤱᤘᤠ᤹ᤑᤢᤔᤠᤱᤅᤡᤸᤗᤧ ᤁᤢᤔᤏᤠᤏᤡᤱ